1-4fa8-9809-7421282270a5.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2022","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533573/77265533573.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2021","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533573/68572533573.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2020","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533573/5335730320.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2019","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533573/5335730319.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2018","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533573/5335730318.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2017","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533573/5335730317.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2016","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533573/5335730316.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2015","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533573/5335730315.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2014","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533573/5335730314.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533573/5335730313.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2012","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533573/5335730312.pdf","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Management reported a strong second quarter for FY27 with consolidated revenue growing 36% year-on-year to INR 2,603 crores, driven by robust performance across all businesses. The U.S. generics business saw an exceptional quarter supported by base volume growth and new launches like bosutinib, while the India business returned to double-digit growth in human health. Reflecting the stronger-than-expected performance in the U.S. and API segments, the company raised its full-year FY27 consolidated revenue growth guidance to 20% to 25%.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"The company raised its FY27 consolidated revenue growth guidance to about 20% to 25%.","quote":"Reflecting the stronger outlook for the U.S. and API, we are raising our FY27 consolidated revenue growth guidance to about 20% to 25% from the mid-teens indicated last quarter.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=5991f5bd-f70d-4eb3-bd32-07b794edf376.pdf"},{"claim":"Management expects the U.S. business to grow up to 40% year-on-year for the full year FY27.","quote":"We now expect the U.S. business to grow up to 40% Y-on-Y for the full year, supported by base business volumes, new launches and continued scale-up of our specialty portfolio.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=5991f5bd-f70d-4eb3-bd32-07b794edf376.pdf"},{"claim":"The API business is expected to deliver at least high teens growth for the year.","quote":"API business has also performed ahead of our expectations and is now expected to deliver at least high teens growth for the year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=5991f5bd-f70d-4eb3-bd32-07b794edf376.pdf"},{"claim":"The India branded business is expected to grow as per the market and reach double digits.","quote":"To reiterate, we expect India branded business to grow as per the market, get close to the market to double digits and directionally aligning with the market growth.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=5991f5bd-f70d-4eb3-bd32-07b794edf376.pdf"},{"claim":"The ex-U.S. business is expected to grow at mid-teens.","quote":"We expect the ex-U.S. to grow at mid-teens.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=5991f5bd-f70d-4eb3-bd32-07b794edf376.pdf"},{"claim":"The company expects the overall growth outlook for the company to improve from the low double-digit range to closer to the mid-teen range for FY27.","quote":"As a result, we believe the overall growth outlook for the company can improve from the low double-digit range that we had discussed earlier to closer to the mid-teen range for FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=b8f27d1b-f644-4885-a463-793dbbfce7ca.pdf"},{"claim":"Management now expects the U.S. business to grow mid to high teens in the year.","quote":"At the beginning of the year, we had indicated that the US Generics could grow in the low to mid-teens based on the performance and the trends we're seeing in Q1, the launch outlook and current volume trends, we now expect the US business to grow mid to high teens in the year, subject to normal market conditions and continued execution.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=b8f27d1b-f644-4885-a463-793dbbfce7ca.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Management expects the acute portfolio in India to improve progressively over the coming quarters.","quote":"We expect the acute portfolio to improve progressively over the coming quarters as well.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=5991f5bd-f70d-4eb3-bd32-07b794edf376.pdf"},{"claim":"The near-term objective in India is to reach market-level growth in the next two to three quarters.","quote":"In India, our near term objective is to reach market level growth in the next 2 to 3 quarters.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=5991f5bd-f70d-4eb3-bd32-07b794edf376.pdf"},{"claim":"The API business experienced volume-led growth backed by healthy customer demand.","quote":"Volume led growth underpinned by healthy customer demand.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f6ef52d7-552d-47ae-adce-c82ce091ad53.pdf"},{"claim":"Pricing pressure remains in the environment, but growth during the quarter was predominantly volume driven.","quote":"Pricing pressure remains in the environment, but growth during the quarter was predominantly volume driven.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=b8f27d1b-f644-4885-a463-793dbbfce7ca.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"The company spent about INR 250 crores of capex for the first half of the financial year.","quote":"Moving on to capital expenditure for the first half. We spent about INR250 crores of capex.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=5991f5bd-f70d-4eb3-bd32-07b794edf376.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Gross margin expanded by 70 basis points year-on-year to 73.7% for the quarter.","quote":"Gross margin expanded by 70 basis points year-on-year to 73.7%, benefiting from favorable product mix despite higher solvent costs and geopolitical headwinds.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=5991f5bd-f70d-4eb3-bd32-07b794edf376.pdf"},{"claim":"The company continues to operate within its guided gross margin range of 70% to 75%.","quote":"We continue to operate within our guided range of 70% to 75% gross margins.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=5991f5bd-f70d-4eb3-bd32-07b794edf376.pdf"},{"claim":"Reported EBITDA grew 78% while EBITDA margin expanded to 22.2% in the current quarter.","quote":"Reported EBITDA grew 78%, while the EBITDA margin expanded by around 520 basis points from 17% in quarter 2 of last year to 22.2% in the current quarter.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=5991f5bd-f70d-4eb3-bd32-07b794edf376.pdf"},{"claim":"Reported EBITDA grew at 21% year-on-year to INR348 crores with EBITDA margin at 16%.","quote":"Reported EBITDA grew at 21% year-on-year to INR348 crores with EBITDA margin at 16%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=b8f27d1b-f644-4885-a463-793dbbfce7ca.pdf"},{"claim":"R&D expenditure during the quarter was at INR186 crores, representing about 9% of revenue.","quote":"As planned, we continue to invest behind future growth opportunities and our R&D expenditure during the quarter was at INR186 crores, representing about 9% of revenue, driven by peptide development activities, exhibit batches and higher regulatory filings and portfolio development initiatives.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=b8f27d1b-f644-4885-a463-793dbbfce7ca.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"The company has 188 commercialized products as on date.","quote":"10 products launched in H1 FY27 with a total number of 188 products commercialized as on date.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f6ef52d7-552d-47ae-adce-c82ce091ad53.pdf"},{"claim":"The company recorded 153 cumulative DMF filings with the US FDA.","quote":"153 Cumulative DMF filings with the US FDA","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f6ef52d7-552d-47ae-adce-c82ce091ad53.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"Net debt stands at INR 1,236 crores, which is less than 1x of full-year EBITDA.","quote":"Net debt remains comfortable at INR1,236 crores, which is less than 1x of full year EBITDA.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=5991f5bd-f70d-4eb3-bd32-07b794edf376.pdf"},{"claim":"Gross debt was at around INR1,600 crores as of June.","quote":"So gross debt was about -- we are at around INR1,600 crores of gross debt and 2 things have happened.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=b8f27d1b-f644-4885-a463-793dbbfce7ca.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"The materials and information presented may include forward-looking statements subject to general industry, market, and economic conditions.","quote":"The materials and information presented herein may include forward looking statements , which reflect current expectations, projections, and assumptions. These statements are inherently subject to risks and uncertainties that could cause actual results or outcomes to differ materially from those anticipated.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f6ef52d7-552d-47ae-adce-c82ce091ad53.pdf"},{"claim":"The external environment continues to remain competitive with pricing pressure, regulatory expectations and geopolitical uncertainties.","quote":"The external environment continues to remain competitive with pricing pressure, regulatory expectations and geopolitical uncertainties.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=b8f27d1b-f644-4885-a463-793dbbfce7ca.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"The company's existing pipeline supports a steady cadence of more than 30 launches over the next 18 months.","quote":"Our existing pipeline supports a steady cadence of more than 30 launches over the next 18 months with around a quarter of them comprising of FTF or shared day-1 opportunities.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=5991f5bd-f70d-4eb3-bd32-07b794edf376.pdf","timeframe":"next 18 months"},{"claim":"Contributions from the DifGen collaboration are expected to begin from FY28.","quote":"Contributions are expected to begin from FY28 with the initial wave of launches providing near-term revenue visibility and a platform for progressively increasing contribution to the U.S. business as the portfolio is commercialized over the next few years.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=5991f5bd-f70d-4eb3-bd32-07b794edf376.pdf","timeframe":"FY28"},{"claim":"Management expects the U.S. branded specialty business to start contributing positively to profit next financial year onwards.","quote":"As the U.S. Branded Specialty business scales up over the next few quarters, we will see a positive contribution to profit, which should consequently drive a broader enhancement in consolidated margins.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=b8f27d1b-f644-4885-a463-793dbbfce7ca.pdf","timeframe":"next financial year onwards"},{"claim":"Management plans to launch another 15-odd products in the U.S. for the rest of the year.","quote":"Yes. I think for the rest of the year, we should be launching another 15-odd products.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=b8f27d1b-f644-4885-a463-793dbbfce7ca.pdf","timeframe":""}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["concall_transcript","concall_ppt"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":27,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":6,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}